# src/apps/daemon/internal/adapters/api

## Purpose
Gin HTTP/WebSocket adapter and served-route inventory. Translates requests into lower-module intent and reports capability truth without owning competing runtime state.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `adapters` (rank 6; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (127): `advanced_route_truth.go`, `advanced_route_truth_test.go`, `config_mutation.go`, `config_mutation_test.go`, `doctor.go`, `doctor_context_test.go`, `handlers_capabilities.go`, `handlers_capabilities_test.go`, `handlers_circumvention_catalog.go`, `handlers_diagnostic_doctor.go`, `handlers_diagnostic_iperf.go`, `handlers_diagnostic_iperf_test.go` …

